# Training agreement — contract body
#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:16
msgid "1. Subject of the agreement"
msgstr "1. Subject of the agreement"

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:19
msgid ""
"The Course provides training services to the Learner under the selected "
"programme. The Course training programmes include: foreign languages "
"(English, Russian, German, French and other languages), international exam "
"preparation (IELTS, SAT, GRE, GMAT, PMS) and other subjects. The subject the "
"Learner registered for:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:24
msgid ""
"The training group is determined according to the selected programme, the "
"Learner's level of knowledge and schedule."
msgstr ""

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:29
msgid "2. Payment terms"
msgstr "2. Payment terms"

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:36
msgid "Payment is made in cash or by bank transfer."
msgstr "Payment is made in cash or by bank transfer."

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:40
msgid ""
"The amount paid is non-refundable if the Learner leaves the course of their "
"own accord."
msgstr ""

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:45
msgid "3. Rights and obligations of the parties"
msgstr "3. Rights and obligations of the parties"

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:46
msgid "3.1. Rights and obligations of the Course:"
msgstr "3.1. Rights and obligations of the Course:"

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:48
msgid "3.1.1. To provide the Learner with quality training services."
msgstr "3.1.1. To provide the Learner with quality training services."

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:49
msgid "3.1.2. To deliver the lesson schedule to the Learner on time."
msgstr "3.1.2. To deliver the lesson schedule to the Learner on time."

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:50
msgid "3.1.3. To replace the instructor when necessary."
msgstr "3.1.3. To replace the instructor when necessary."

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:51
msgid ""
"3.1.4. To issue an appropriate certificate to the Learner who successfully "
"completes the course."
msgstr ""

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:53
msgid "3.2. Rights and obligations of the Learner:"
msgstr "3.2. Rights and obligations of the Learner:"

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:55
msgid "3.2.1. To attend lessons on time according to the lesson schedule."
msgstr "3.2.1. To attend lessons on time according to the lesson schedule."

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:56
msgid ""
"3.2.2. The Learner may miss one (1) lesson per month without a valid excuse. "
"In that case, no fee is charged for that lesson. Second and subsequent "
"missed lessons are considered forfeited."
msgstr ""

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:57
msgid ""
"3.2.3. If missing a lesson, to notify a Course representative at least one "
"(1) day before the lesson. Notice given on the day of the lesson is grounds "
"for the lesson to be considered forfeited."
msgstr ""

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:58
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "3.2.1. To attend lessons on time according to the lesson schedule."
msgid ""
"3.2.4. To complete the instructor's assignments and not disrupt the lesson "
"schedule."
msgstr "3.2.1. To attend lessons on time according to the lesson schedule."

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:59
msgid "3.2.5. To observe order and discipline in the classroom."
msgstr "3.2.5. To observe order and discipline in the classroom."

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:64
msgid "4. General provisions"
msgstr "4. General provisions"

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:66
msgid ""
"4.1. This agreement enters into force from the moment of signing and remains "
"in effect until the end of the training period."
msgstr ""

#: templates/includes/course_payment_contract.html:67
msgid ""
"4.2. In cases not provided for in this agreement, the civil legislation of "
"the Republic of Azerbaijan applies."
